u201318 Sept 2026, not 14\u201318 Sept as the v2 draft said and not 14\u201418 Sept as the CMS rendered it.  Legal signed off on Tuesday; Marta wants the \u201cbeta\u201d label gone and the \"preview\"  badge hidden in the same release.\n","textStyle":{}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT"}}},{"startIndex":381,"endIndex":608,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":381,"endIndex":397,"textRun":{"content":"Ana\u2019s note: the ","textStyle":{}}},{"startIndex":397,"endIndex":410,"textRun":{"content":"launch window","textStyle":{"italic":true}}},{"startIndex":410,"endIndex":504,"textRun":{"content":" is not the same thing as the Launch Window banner in the app; the banner string lives in the ","textStyle":{}}},{"startIndex":504,"endIndex":512,"textRun":{"content":"release ","textStyle":{"underline":true,"foregroundColor":{"color":{"rgbColor":{"red":0.06666667,"green":0.33333334,"blue":0.8}}},"link":{"url":"https://example.com/northstar/checklist"}}}},{"startIndex":512,"endIndex":521,"textRun":{"content":"checklist","textStyle":{"bold":true,"underline":true,"foregroundColor":{"color":{"rgbColor":{"red":0.06666667,"green":0.33333334,"blue":0.8}}},"link":{"url":"https://example.com/northstar/checklist"}}}},{"startIndex":521,"endIndex":560,"textRun":{"content":" and is owned by design.  See also the ","textStyle":{}}},{"startIndex":560,"endIndex":577,"textRun":{"content":"launch window FAQ","textStyle":{"underline":true,"foregroundColor":{"color":{"rgbColor":{"red":0.06666667,"green":0.33333334,"blue":0.8}}},"link":{"url":"https://example.com/northstar/faq"}}}},{"startIndex":577,"endIndex":608,"textRun":{"content":" before replying to customers.\n","textStyle":{}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT"}}},{"startIndex":608,"endIndex":765,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":608,"endIndex":710,"textRun":{"content":"If anything slips, the launch window moves as a whole; we do not ship half the features. Live status: ","textStyle":{}}},{"startIndex":710,"endIndex":746,"textRun":{"content":"https://status.example.com/northstar","textStyle":{"underline":true,"foregroundColor":{"color":{"rgbColor":{"red":0.06666667,"green":0.33333334,"blue":0.8}}},"link":{"url":"https://status.example.com/northstar"}}}},{"startIndex":746,"endIndex":765,"textRun":{"content":" (updated hourly).\n","textStyle":{}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT"}}},{"startIndex":765,"endIndex":791,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":765,"endIndex":791,"textRun":{"content":"Copy for the announcement\n","textStyle":{}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"headingId":"h.byuqhsf8tc6o","namedStyleType":"HEADING_2","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT"}}},{"startIndex":791,"endIndex":1111,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":791,"endIndex":839,"textRun":{"content":"Northstar 2.2 is the biggest release since 1.0: ","textStyle":{}}},{"startIndex":839,"endIndex":859,"textRun":{"content":"release-notes-2.1.md","textStyle":{"underline":true,"foregroundColor":{"color":{"rgbColor":{"red":0.06666667,"green":0.33333334,"blue":0.8}}},"link":{"url":"http://release-notes-2.1.md"}}}},{"startIndex":859,"endIndex":1111,"textRun":{"content":" (more soon...) as Marta put it in #launch, \u201cwe finally fixed the sync bug that ate everyone\u2019s Tuesday afternoon\u201d and the landing-page draft says Faster sync. Fewer surprises. More soon\u2026 (Tom\u00e1s pasted that last bit from the web page, hence the fonts.)\n","textStyle":{}}}],"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","direction":"LEFT_TO_RIGHT"}}},{"startIndex":1111,"endIndex":1349,"paragraph":{"elements":[{"startIndex":1111,"endIndex":1142,"textRun":{"content":"The formula card still reads CO","textStyle":{}}},{"startIndex":1142,"endIndex":1143,"textRun":{"content":"2","textStyle":{"baselineOffset":"SUBSCRIPT"}}},{"startIndex":1143,"endIndex":1149,"textRun":{"content":" and x","textStyle":{}}},{"startIndex":1149,"endIndex":